<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>IaC Monitoring Stack - Web Server</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #1a1a1a;
            color: #e0e0e0;
        }
        h1 { color: #4CAF50; }
        .info {
            background: #2a2a2a;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info p { margin: 8px 0; }
        code {
            background: #333;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            color: #FFC107;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1> IaC Monitoring Stack</h1>
    <div class="info">
        <p><strong>Server:</strong> <code>{{ ansible_facts.hostname }}</code></p>
        <p><strong>FQDN:</strong> <code>{{ ansible_facts.fqdn }}</code></p>
        <p><strong>IP:</strong> <code>{{ ansible_facts.default_ipv4.address | default('N/A') }}</code></p>
        <p><strong>OS:</strong> <code>{{ ansible_facts.distribution }} {{ ansible_facts.distribution_version }}</code></p>
        <p><strong>Managed by:</strong> <code>Ansible</code></p>
    </div>
    <p>This page is deployed automatically by the <code>apache</code> role.</p>
    <p>Monitoring available at: <code>/server-status</code> (internal only)</p>
</body>
